// [MermaidChart: 1728135e-7d6a-4645-ad8d-6a25c0f5e07e]
sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor FE as Frontend / Postman
participant GW as Gateway :8099
participant AUTH as Auth Service :8091
participant ADB as Auth DB
participant SMTP as SMTP

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Login
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/login
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Find user + validate password
AUTH->>AUTH: Create access/refresh tokens
AUTH->>ADB: Save refresh token + update last login
AUTH-->>GW: LoginData
GW-->>FE: 200
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SMTP: Forgot Password
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password
GW->>AUTH: Forward (public)
AUTH->>ADB: Find user/email
alt user and email exists
    AUTH->>ADB: Save OTP token
    AUTH->>SMTP: Send OTP
end
AUTH-->>GW: Generic success
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Verify OTP
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/verify-reset-otp
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Validate OTP
alt valid OTP
    AUTH->>ADB: Mark otpVerified + save resetToken
    AUTH-->>GW: resetToken
else invalid OTP
    AUTH-->>GW: 400
end
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Reset Password
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Validate resetToken
alt valid resetToken
    AUTH->>ADB: Update password + mark used + clear refresh tokens
    AUTH-->>GW: Success
else invalid resetToken
    AUTH-->>GW: 400
end
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: Change Password
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/change-password (Bearer)
GW->>AUTH: Forward
AUTH->>ADB: Validate current password
AUTH->>ADB: Save new password + clear refresh tokens
AUTH-->>GW: Success
GW-->>FE: Response
end
